message: "If you use these findings or tools, please cite them as below."
title: "Knotlab: findings and intuitions of the contact-first program"
authors:
  - name: "Prespatial Labs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jscul/knotlab"
url: "https://github.com/jscul/knotlab"
date-released: 2026-11-05
version: "2026-11-05"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Findings of the contact-first research program: the logical knot (a relation
  constrained as a whole and unconstrained in every part), why pairwise
  constraints cannot make one while three-place constraints can, what knots
  hide and remember, how deep a hidden bit is, and where counting what emerges
  becomes hard. Each finding comes with a proof and a check.
